    "public_api_change": "ADDITIVE",
    "schema_diff_summary": "Add refresh_indent_folds. It reads the document text and tab_width. It calls apply_indent_folds on every view of that document. Call it at the end of apply_change, at the end of replace_from_load, and at the end of new_view. An empty buffer stores an empty fold list. The header rule from PKT-0087 stays. For a, newline, two spaces, b, newline, the range is offset 1 through offset 6. Leave view.rs and fold.rs unchanged. Leave theme.rs, paint.rs, layout.rs, and session.rs unchanged. PKT-0085, PKT-0088, and PKT-0089 own those files. Branch from the current tip of main. base_sha records that tip at planning time. If main has moved, use the new tip."
  },
